# openclaw-claude-loop / Talos experts — environment template
# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit the real .env (see .gitignore).
# All keys are OPTIONAL — the loop runs without any of them. They unlock
# specific experts / MCPs (see experts/README.md "MCP wiring").

# --- Model selection (optional) ---
# Model the spawned `claude -p` builder uses. Defaults to the Claude CLI default.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=

# --- Talos experts toggle (optional) ---
# Force-enable the expert roster without editing config.json (1/true/yes/on).
# TALOS_EXPERTS=1

# --- Context7 MCP (optional — raises rate limits; free tier needs no key) ---
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=

# --- Stripe MCP (optional — backend-payments expert). USE A TEST KEY ONLY. ---
# STRIPE_API_KEY=sk_test_xxx

# --- GitHub MCP (optional — devops-deploy / PR automation) ---
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxx

# --- Asset generation MCP (optional — growth-copy creative assets) ---
# HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY=
